# WalletConnect / Reown project id — required for the WalletConnect connector
# (e.g. connecting a Safe multisig) to authenticate with the relay and produce a
# `wc:` pairing link. Create a free project at https://dashboard.reown.com and
# copy its Project ID (32-char hex). Without it the app falls back to a placeholder
# and no WalletConnect QR/link is generated.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your value (Vite reads .env.local at startup).
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
